I utilized (or did my best too) the elif function. Yay!

Heres the code...

/* This is default touch navigation */
void main( )
{
     while(1) {
          if (digital(7) == 1) (digital(8) == 1) (digital(9) == 1)
          {
                 fd(1);
                 fd(3);
           } 
          elif (digital(7) == 0) (digital(8) == 1) (digital(9) == 1)
          { 
                 fd(1);
                  off(3);
                  sleep(1.2);
